        <p>%MdmduiiMeand%!lenV°</p>
        <p>The • County Motor Co. Stockton Heath Garage, Warrington. S. - 4 - • iab a a</p>
        <p>It's worth while remembering our Telephone Number:</p>
        <p>65 Stockton</p>
      </div>
