        <p>Deaths. ROWSE.—On November 4th, at Penrhyn House, Llandudno. Thomas Rowse. aged 64 years. In- terred at Blackpool on Tuesday, November 9th. KIDD.—On November 11th, at Ashwood-avenue. Padgate, Ann Kidd. wife of Thomas Kidd, aged 54 years; late of Folly-lane Post Office. LEIGH.—On November 3rd, at her residence, 9, Mount-street. Sarah Jane,,, widow of the late Peter. Leigh, aged 72 years. PICKTON.—On the 11th inst., at her residPnce, Paul-street, Anne, relict of the late Thomas Eng- land Pickton. in her 81st year. Service at St. Paul's Church, Monday, 2 o'clock. Acknowledgments. •mits. j. C. DAVIES i'and FAMILY wish THANK their many friends for their kind* sympathy and floral tributes-during their recent sad bereavement. •</p>
