        <p>PRIVATE L. V. HOLBROOK. Who went to somewhere in France upon enlistment.</p>
        <p>Club, being both a good batsman and bowler. lie is 26 years of age, and attended Silver-street Day School. Private Leonard Venables Holbrook is the son of Mr. W. Holbrook, 266, Manchester-road, an employe of Messrs. Greening, and a well- known Friendly Society worker. Private Hol- brook, who is 23 years of age, is an employe of the Co-operative Society, and following in the steps of his father, an Oddfellow of the Man- chester Unity.</p>
